codex
I’m going after the initial layernorm/projection boundary now. Algebraically, `Linear(LayerNorm(x))` can be rewritten as one raw-input GEMM plus a per-row mean/rstd correction. I’m adding a Triton mean/rstd kernel and folding norm affine terms into the cached projection weights so the normalized `[B,N,N,dim]` tensor no longer has to be materialized.
